Package: gr-gsm
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         libgnuradio-gsm1.0.0 (= ${binary:Version}),
         gnuradio (>= 3.10),
         gr-osmosdr,
         python3-numpy
Recommends: python3-scipy
Description: GNU Radio blocks and tools for receiving GSM transmissions
 gr-gsm decodes the GSM air interface from an SDR or from a recording of
 samples: it finds the base stations, demodulates the bursts, decodes the
 control channels, the speech channels and, when the key is known, the
 A5/1 encrypted ones. Decoded frames can be sent as GSMTAP to Wireshark.
 .
 The package contains the GNU Radio Companion blocks, the Python module
 gnuradio.gsm and the tools grgsm_scanner, grgsm_livemon, grgsm_decode,
 grgsm_capture and grgsm_channelize. The transceiver interface for
 OsmocomBB is not included.

Package: libgnuradio-gsm1.0.0
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: GNU Radio blocks for receiving GSM transmissions (library)
 The shared library of the gr-gsm blocks: the receiver, the demappers, the
 channel decoders and the decryption of A5/1.

Package: gr-gsm-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         libgnuradio-gsm1.0.0 (= ${binary:Version}),
         gnuradio-dev (>= 3.10)
Description: GNU Radio blocks for receiving GSM transmissions (development files)
 The C++ headers and the CMake package of gr-gsm, for building blocks and
 applications on top of it.
